# {{ project_name }}

A new Python project.

## Getting Started
{% if docker == "venv" %}
Create and activate a virtual environment, then install dependencies:

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```
{% elif docker == "docker" %}
Build and start the project with Docker Compose:

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and adjust values before starting:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up --build
```
{% else %}
Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```
{% endif %}

## Running
{% if docker == "docker" %}
```bash
docker compose up
```

To run a one-off command inside the container:

```bash
docker compose run --rm app python -m {{ pkg_name }}
```
{% else %}
```bash
python -m {{ pkg_name }}
```
{% endif %}
